# --- the new file ---
# AnixOps Control configuration, written by `anix-control config rewrite`
# from /opt/anixops/control/config/config.yaml on 2026-10-13T08:00:00Z.
# Keys and defaults: docs/reference/configuration.md. The root key and the
# secrets it adopted are in data_dir/root.key, not in this file.
domain: panel.example.com
tls:
  mode: external
  cert_file: /etc/anix-control/tls/fullchain.pem
  key_file: /etc/anix-control/tls/privkey.pem
listen: 127.0.0.1:9080
grpc:
  public_name: grpc.example.com
# --- the report ---
New keys:
  domain: panel.example.com; the panel's name
  tls.mode: external
  tls.cert_file: /etc/anix-control/tls/fullchain.pem
  tls.key_file: /etc/anix-control/tls/privkey.pem
  listen: 127.0.0.1:9080
  grpc.public_name: grpc.example.com

Dropped:
  grpc.port: the default (50051)
  server.trusted_proxies: still read until M2 (P11), not written: the reverse proxies of a container deployment; afterwards tls.mode acme trusts none and tls.mode external trusts loopback
  subscribe_path: the default (s)

Notes:
  tls.mode external: point the reverse proxy at 127.0.0.1:9080 for the whole panel (web, /api, subscriptions, /install): it is one listener now
